QtPi firmware artifacts
=======================

The machine-readable release catalog is `manifest.json`.

ESP32 Firmata releases are stored under:

    veda-esp32/firmata-dual/v<version>/qtpi-esp32-firmata-v<version>.bin

QtPi MicroPython releases are stored under:

    veda-esp32/micropython/v<version>/qtpi-esp32-micropython-v<version>.bin

QtPi MicroPython product versions are independent of the bundled upstream
MicroPython runtime version. Current QtPi images merge the bootloader,
partition table, application, and populated LittleFS partition into one binary
that is flashed at offset `0x0000`.

The `latest/` directory mirrors the artifact selected by `defaultVersion` in
the manifest. Versioned directories are immutable after publication.
